# Slash Workflows / Commands

If the user starts a prompt with any of the following slash commands (e.g. `/middle`), you MUST immediately read the corresponding file in `.agent/workflows/<command>.md` and execute its instructions verbatim. DO NOT explain what the command does, just execute it.

Available commands:
- `/start`
- `/proceed`
- `/middle`
- `/end`
- `/skill-skill`
- `/review`
- `/opp`
